<title>UK: DNIB sets 10.0 bln pta Feb 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 10.0 bln pta Feb 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following matador bond issue was announced by lead manager Caja de Madrid.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON    *7.0 PCT   MATURITY    20 FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC   1.625</p>
<p> NOTES	*YEARS ONE TO FOUR, THEN 13.20 PCT LESS ONE YEAR</p>
<p>		LIBOR SUBJECT TO A MINIMUM OF 3.0 PERCENT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
